BiliDown NAS

Based on Bilidown by iuroc and its contributors:
https://github.com/iuroc/bilidown
Upstream baseline: 6b196f57473a36ccd7c77104e5aa01ca046b7836

This repository retains the upstream Apache License 2.0 and Git history.
NAS adaptation and UI changes: FredQin, 2026.
Changes include a headless server entry point, configurable storage, restricted
server-mode file access, Docker deployment, health checks, download robustness,
regression tests, and a refreshed responsive web interface.

